+# MASTER7 v163 COBA8 front-end registration
+
+Release: `17.0.0-selfbuilt.163-coba8-front-end-registered`
+
+## Member front end
+
+- COBA8 is registered as one distinct game-provider brand and one independent
+  `coba8_myr` profile in the member Game Lobby.
+- The lobby uses a neutral MASTER7-owned provider card derived from the existing
+  premium lobby artwork. It contains no third-party logo or copied supplier art.
+- Existing owner-curated 37-provider rankings migrate without changing their
+  order; COBA8 is appended once as the 38th provider.
+
+## Contract boundary
+
+The supplied merchant login and API token are credentials, not an API contract.
+The available environment could not retrieve official COBA8 documentation
+through the supplier's Cloudflare challenge. The following remain unverified:
+authentication and signature rules, base URLs, IP allowlists, catalogue, player,
+launch, wallet, transfer/query, report/settlement, callback, session closure,
+recovery, limits, errors and UAT acceptance.
+
+`lib/coba8-contract-readiness.ts` reports the exact missing documentation fields
+without reflecting any supplied credential value. A complete documentation
+manifest remains documentation-only and still cannot enable an adapter.
+
+## Safety state
+
+COBA8 remains `contract_missing` and `adapter_unimplemented` in operational
+terms. Catalogue, player, launch, Play, wallet, settlement and recovery are all
+false. The release contains no COBA8 network request, player creation, game
+launch or wallet movement, does not persist the supplied login or token, and
+changes no real-money or live-game switch.
